---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="A little about Marc and this site."
>
	<article class="container about">
		<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
		<h1>Hi, I'm Marc.</h1>
		<div class="prose">
			<p>
				I make small things and write about them. Most of what I build lives at
				the intersection of software and the physical world — a Raspberry Pi on
				the desk, an automation that runs while I sleep, a little app that
				scratches one specific itch.
			</p>
			<p>
				This site is my show-and-tell shelf. Nothing here is trying to be a
				product. It's a place to keep the experiments and the notes, mostly so I
				remember what I learned.
			</p>
			<p>
				Want to say hi? Find me on
				<a href="https://github.com">GitHub</a> or drop a line at
				<a href="mailto:hello@example.com">hello@example.com</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</article>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about {
		max-width: var(--measure);
		padding-block: var(--space-16) var(--space-8);
	}

	.about h1 {
		margin-top: var(--space-3);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
	}
</style>

<style is:global>
	.about .prose > * + * {
		margin-top: var(--space-4);
	}
</style>
